        "1. Open PH3 Image Tool before queueing. Import an image or create a canvas.\n2. Select installed P-H3 models in Settings. Generate inside the editor; generation uses the normal ComfyUI queue.\n3. Adopt results, then Save / Apply to Node. Save this ComfyUI workflow too.\n4. Queue this workflow to send the committed RGB image to SaveImage. Use editor PNG export for alpha.\nOptional: connect an IMAGE upstream and execute once, then use Import input in the editor.\nRC: live ComfyUI/GPU/Windows acceptance testing remains required."
